{ "Identifier":       {"ImplementerID": "IIDRA-assigned", "ImplementationID": "MMC-CAS-V2.5-I01", "AIMName": "MMC-CAS-V2.5"},
  "Header":            "MMC-CAS-V2.5",

  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "Description":      "Conversation About a Scene (slide 7 of the MMC Reference Models): a conversation with a machine about what a camera shows. Visual Scene Description describes the scene, Visual Object Identification gives the Instance Identifier of the object the person indicates, Automatic Speech Recognition and Natural Language Understanding take what the person says (the Text Descriptors Object is the former Meaning), Personal Status Extraction gives the personal status of the person, Entity Dialogue Processing the answer and the Personal Status of the machine, and Portable Avatar Multiplexing the Portable Avatar, which needs the ID of the machine. The View Selector and the Point of View of the slide are not taken: Portable Avatar Multiplexing (slide 13) has no input for them.",

